cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CRU-Harness, cite this software and separately acknowledge the benchmark and baseline sources used."
type: software
title: "Context Is All You Need: Context Read and Understand Harness (CRU-Harness)"
authors:
  - name: "CRU-Harness contributors"
version: "3.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
repository-code: "https://github.com/quxiaoqiya/CRU-Harness"
url: "https://github.com/quxiaoqiya/CRU-Harness"
abstract: >-
  CRU-Harness is a standalone execution harness for reading and understanding
  sources beyond a model's single-call context window. It combines bounded
  model calls with source-bound facts, typed aggregation, exact-body reuse,
  explicit unknown bounds, shared generation budgets and replayable audits.
keywords:
  - long context
  - language model harness
  - provenance
  - evidence aggregation
  - benchmark auditing
